  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "運輸需求分析",
    "sub_ename": "TRANSPORTATION DEMAND ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹離散選擇分析方法及其在旅運行為模式的應用。本課程目標希望學生能對運輸需求的理論與應用有所了解，並能熟練分析技巧與電腦軟體用於探討運輸行為。個案分析包含旅客與貨物運輸。",
    "describe_eh": "The course introduces the methods of discrete choice analysis and their applications in the modeling of travel behavior. The objective of this course is to provide students with an understanding theories and practices of travel demand and familiarizing the use of analytical techniques and computer software to investigate travel behavior. Case studies include passenger and freight transportation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
